{
  "declaredLength": 8428,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Dis-moi, jeune <U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿЄhommfille. Connais-tu le Pokémon\nqui porte le nom de Rozbouton ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Roooz ! ♪",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0052006F006F006F007A002000210020266A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Les Rozbouton sont très résistants au froid,\njusqu’à ce que leur bourgeon éclose.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je décèle en toi les qualités nécessaires pour\naider un Rozbouton à s’épanouir avec splendeur !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nJe me permets donc de t’inviter à participer à\nnotre concours réservé aux Rozbouton.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 188
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si tu es intéressé<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe, rends-toi sur la place avec une\nfontaine, dans le 8ᵉ arrondissement de Valcyan.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 110
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il faut s’assurer que les Rozbouton sont en\nbonne santé !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049006C00200066006100750074002000732019006100730073007500720065007200200071007500650020006C0065007300200052006F007A0062006F00750074006F006E00200073006F006E007400200065006E000A0062006F006E006E0065002000730061006E007400E90020002100100002011401940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ce que je regarde chez les Rozbouton, c’est\nleur expression et leur façon de se mouvoir.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Nous t’attendions, jeune <U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿЄhommfille.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F007500730020007420190061007400740065006E00640069006F006E0073002C0020006A00650075006E0065002000100003110000FF04040068006F006D006D00660069006C006C0065002E00100002011401300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu n’as pas de Rozbouton dans ton équipe ? Il va\nfalloir y remédier pour participer à notre concours.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 106
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je vois que tu as un Rozbouton dans ton équipe.\nTrès bien !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A006500200076006F00690073002000710075006500200074007500200061007300200075006E00200052006F007A0062006F00750074006F006E002000640061006E007300200074006F006E002000E900710075006900700065002E000A0054007200E800730020006200690065006E0020002100100002011401300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu t’appelles <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> ? Voilà un prénom\nprésageant une florissante carrière de Dresseu<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȁrse.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Les frais d’inscription au concours s’élèvent\nà 5 800 <U+E300>. Es-tu partant<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je paie !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A006500200070006100690065002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Euh, il faut payer ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004500750068002C00200069006C002000660061007500740020007000610079006500720020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je comprends ta réticence, mais ton Rozbouton\net toi avez toutes vos chances !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Malheureusement, tu n’as pas la somme\ndemandée.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0061006C00680065007500720065007500730065006D0065006E0074002C0020007400750020006E20190061007300200070006100730020006C006100200073006F006D006D0065000A00640065006D0061006E006400E90065002E00100002011401300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bien, le concours peut commencer.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 3020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004200690065006E002C0020006C006500200063006F006E0063006F0075007200730020007000650075007400200063006F006D006D0065006E006300650072002E00100002011401300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3096,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Reviens me voir lorsque tu auras un Rozbouton\ndans ton équipe.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00520065007600690065006E00730020006D006500200076006F006900720020006C006F0072007300710075006500200074007500200061007500720061007300200075006E00200052006F007A0062006F00750074006F006E000A00640061006E007300200074006F006E002000E900710075006900700065002E00100002011401300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je vous propose d’accueillir notre premier\nparticipant : le Rozbouton de Florèle !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bou...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0042006F0075002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Le lustre de son bourgeon est absolument\nremarquable !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C00650020006C0075007300740072006500200064006500200073006F006E00200062006F0075007200670065006F006E00200065007300740020006100620073006F006C0075006D0065006E0074000A00720065006D006100720071007500610062006C00650020002100100002011401940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Certes, mais sa façon de se mouvoir n’a rien\nde transcendant. Je ne suis pas convaincue.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Son cri laisse penser qu’il a le trac.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006F006E00200063007200690020006C00610069007300730065002000700065006E00730065007200200071007520190069006C002000610020006C006500200074007200610063002E00100002011401300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Accueillons maintenant notre deuxième\nparticipant : le Rozbouton de Dominique !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bouton !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 4012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0042006F00750074006F006E002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sa posture inspire l’autorité et laisse présager\nune grande force.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006100200070006F0073007400750072006500200069006E007300700069007200650020006C2019006100750074006F00720069007400E90020006500740020006C0061006900730073006500200070007200E900730061006700650072000A0075006E00650020006700720061006E0064006500200066006F007200630065002E00100002011401930000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’accorde une mention honorable à son cri.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A2019006100630063006F00720064006500200075006E00650020006D0065006E00740069006F006E00200068006F006E006F007200610062006C0065002000E000200073006F006E0020006300720069002E00100002011401300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ce Rozbouton est pâlichon. On dirait qu’il n’a pas\npassé assez de temps au soleil.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Accueillons ensuite notre troisième participant :\nle Rozbouton de Bourgèle.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Boubou !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0042006F00750062006F0075002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quelle taille imposante ! Et regardez-moi tout\nce pollen !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005100750065006C006C00650020007400610069006C006C006500200069006D0070006F00730061006E007400650020002100200045007400200072006500670061007200640065007A002D006D006F006900200074006F00750074000A0063006500200070006F006C006C0065006E0020002100100002011401940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Les mouvements de ce Rozbouton respirent la\ngrâce !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 4756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006500730020006D006F007500760065006D0065006E0074007300200064006500200063006500200052006F007A0062006F00750074006F006E00200072006500730070006900720065006E00740020006C0061000A0067007200E2006300650020002100100002011401930000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Peut-être, mais son cri trahit une certaine\nirritation. Il est sans doute stressé.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 4868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Accueillons maintenant notre quatrième et dernier\nparticipant : le Rozbouton <U+0010><U+0003>ᐈ<U+0000><U+0001><U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 5044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Rozzz !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 5232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0052006F007A007A007A002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ça alors !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 5248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00C7006100200061006C006F007200730020002100100002011401930000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Incroyable...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 5280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049006E00630072006F007900610062006C0065002E002E002E00100002011401940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tiens, tiens...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 5316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400690065006E0073002C0020007400690065006E0073002E002E002E00100002011401300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Regardez-moi ce lustre, cet éclat ! Voilà un\nRozbouton fringant et à l’air déterminé !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 5356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il a le pas léger et enchanteur !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 5540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049006C002000610020006C006500200070006100730020006C00E900670065007200200065007400200065006E006300680061006E00740065007500720020002100100002011401930000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et ses qualités vont au-delà de son apparence !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 5616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045007400200073006500730020007100750061006C0069007400E9007300200076006F006E0074002000610075002D00640065006C00E000200064006500200073006F006E0020006100700070006100720065006E006300650020002100100002011401300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "S’il en impose autant, c’est qu’il fait entièrement\nconfiance à s<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿଋon Dresseura Dresseuse !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 5720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’ai vu de nombreux Rozbouton, mais je n’en ai\njamais vu comme celui-ci !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 5920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je crois que les membres du jury sont unanimes\nquant à ce Rozbouton.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 6076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A0065002000630072006F0069007300200071007500650020006C006500730020006D0065006D00620072006500730020006400750020006A00750072007900200073006F006E007400200075006E0061006E0069006D00650073000A007100750061006E0074002000E000200063006500200052006F007A0062006F00750074006F006E002E00100002011401930000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je confirme.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 6224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A006500200063006F006E006600690072006D0065002E00100002011401300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu nous as vraiment montré un Rozbouton\nexceptionnel.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 6260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400750020006E006F0075007300200061007300200076007200610069006D0065006E00740020006D006F006E0074007200E900200075006E00200052006F007A0062006F00750074006F006E000A0065007800630065007000740069006F006E006E0065006C002E00100002011401300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Peux-tu nous parler de ta rencontre avec lui ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 6376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006500750078002D007400750020006E006F007500730020007000610072006C00650072002000640065002000740061002000720065006E0063006F006E007400720065002000610076006500630020006C007500690020003F00100002011401300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je l’ai rencontré par hasard.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 6480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A00650020006C201900610069002000720065006E0063006F006E0074007200E900200070006100720020006800610073006100720064002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je crois que c’était le destin.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 6540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A0065002000630072006F00690073002000710075006500200063201900E900740061006900740020006C0065002000640065007300740069006E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quel entraînement lui as-tu fait suivre ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 6604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005100750065006C00200065006E00740072006100EE006E0065006D0065006E00740020006C00750069002000610073002D007400750020006600610069007400200073007500690076007200650020003F00100002011401300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, je n’ai rien fait de spécial.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 6696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0068002C0020006A00650020006E2019006100690020007200690065006E0020006600610069007400200064006500200073007000E9006300690061006C002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il s’est entraîné dur.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
